{"id":"wb-4-210","name":"康有为故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"康有为故居","text":"康有为故居位于中华人民共和国广东省佛山市南海区丹灶镇苏村，又称“延香老屋”，是康有为出生、成长的地方，1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。\n康有为故居是一座典型的珠三角地区民居建筑，总面积81平方米，始建于清代中期，部分毁于抗战时期，1983年修复。1987年在旁新建康有为纪念馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BA%B7%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%BA%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":87487561,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87487561","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/84eed621d2e8e8cc78b7fbf1.jpg","title":"Foshan_Kang_Youwei_Guju_20171012.143149.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Foshan_Kang_Youwei_Guju_20171012.143149.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/Foshan_Kang_Youwei_Guju_20171012.143149.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"古海岸遗址","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​康有为故居","width":320,"height":240}}